      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automotive Intel Daily Ingest\n\n**Runs:** 8:00 AM daily\n**Searches:** SDV Zonal \u00b7 SiC Semiconductor \u00b7 ADAS Sensor Fusion \u00b7 EV Battery\n**Model:** claude-sonnet-4-20250514 via Samantha 2.0\n**Writes to:** github.com/ramlensang/sangs-wiki \u2192 raw/articles/\n**Digest to:** your-email@example.com\n\n### Setup Steps (After Import)\n\n**1. GitHub Credential**\n   \u2022 Open **GitHub: Write Article** node\n   \u2022 Replace \"GitHub account\" placeholder with your saved GitHub PAT credential\n\n**2. Test Run (GitHub + Gmail DISABLED)**\n   \u2022 Both nodes start disabled \u2014 run workflow manually\n   \u2022 Inspect **Code: Format Markdown** output to verify markdown shape\n\n**3. Enable GitHub Only**\n   \u2022 Enable **GitHub: Write Article** node\n   \u2022 Run once, confirm file appears in ramlensang/sangs-wiki/raw/articles/\n\n**4. Enable Gmail**\n   \u2022 Enable **Gmail: Send Digest** node\n   \u2022 Do a full run, confirm digest email arrives\n\n**5. Activate Workflow**\n   \u2022 Once verified, activate for daily 8 AM runs\n\n### Notes\n- Files are date-prefixed (YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md) \u2014 unique per day\n- Re-running same day will fail on already-created files\n  (switch to `edit` operation if you need idempotent re-runs)",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 480
      },
